    "scenesThatPass": [
      "ANNA: What are you doing here, Lucie?\nLUCIE: You used to be happy to see me.\nANNA: I still am. I’m just surprised.\nLUCIE: I called. You never called back.",
      "ANNA: Hello?\nLUCIE: I need you to believe me.\nLUCIE: I need you to see them too.\nANNA: Tell me where you are.",
      "ANNA: Lucie?\nANNA: Hello?\nANNA: Oh, God.\nLUCIE: I didn’t have a choice.",
      "LUCIE: Anna! PLEASE!\nANNA: I can’t help you anymore.\nLUCIE: Please...",
      "LUCIE: It’s here, Anna.\nLUCIE: It hurt me again.\nANNA: It’s okay. I’ve got you. I won’t let anything hurt you."
    ]
